stateDiagram-v2
    %% CURRENT implementation; sources and guards in transition inventory.
    state "draft" as draft
    state "pending_approval" as pending_approval
    state "active; ended_at null" as active
    state "state unchanged; ended_at present (derived closed)" as closed
    state "ended (declared; state writer UNKNOWN)" as ended
    state "failed" as failed
    [*] --> draft
    [*] --> pending_approval
    draft --> pending_approval: controller requires approval
    draft --> active: apply operation
    pending_approval --> active: apply operation
    draft --> closed: end operation
    pending_approval --> closed: end operation
    active --> closed: end operation
    failed --> closed: end operation
    ended --> closed: end operation
    active --> closed: EnforcementExpiryJob
    active --> active: retry principal lock and reconcile after state recheck
    closed --> closed: end reconcile / repeat
    note right of active
        Verification completion requires a locked,
        active, owner-matched recovery ceremony.
        Case end and ceremony consumption commit together.
        Apply rechecks the Case under its principal lock.
    end note
    note right of pending_approval
        Apply locks and rechecks persisted Case state.
    end note
